      <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Ship Pattern: Retribution-class. Armoured Prow: this ship has &lt;b&gt;+1 Prow Armour&lt;/b&gt;, already included in her printed Prow value.</characteristic>
