 <sharedRules>
  <rule id="859c11b4-5e33-5c52-9309-cbebb34827ae" name="18th Legion - Into the Fires" hidden="false">
   <description>Whenever a friendly Salamanders ship fires a &lt;b&gt;Macro-Cannon Battery&lt;/b&gt; or &lt;b&gt;Heavy Macro-Cannon Battery&lt;/b&gt; from its &lt;b&gt;Port or Starboard&lt;/b&gt; arc, those weapons gain &lt;b&gt;Flame&lt;/b&gt; for that attack. This is always active — it needs no Evade, no Fleet Order, no manoeuvre, no once-per-round activation and no marker. Prow and Dorsal Macro weapons do not gain Flame from this trait. • &lt;b&gt;Against a target of Armour Value 14 or higher&lt;/b&gt;, a Salamanders &lt;b&gt;Macro-Cannon Battery&lt;/b&gt; triggers its Flame roll on a successful &lt;b&gt;hit&lt;/b&gt; rather than a successful penetration — the fires reach where the shells cannot. See Keyword: Flame.</description>
  </rule>
 </sharedRules>
</catalogue>